## 🛠️ Database Schema

Tables created in MySQL:

- `users(user_id, name, email, password, role)`
- `counselors(counselor_id, name, specialization, availability)`
- `appointments(appointment_id, user_id, counselor_id, date, time, status)`
- `reports(report_id, user_id, description, date_created)`
- `feedback(feedback_id, user_id, message, rating)`
- `resources(resource_id, title, type, link)`

(Relationships defined through primary and foreign keys.)

